      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Blaine's city government was officially dissolved on April 20, 2022, by circuit judge John David Preston, ending its status as a home rule-class city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blaine%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Blaine sits in the valley of Blaine Creek, a northeast‑flowing tributary of the Big Sandy River, with Hood Creek joining from the south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
