      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kentucky Route 32 cuts through Blaine, heading east 18 miles to Louisa and west 20 miles to Sandy Hook; Route 201 runs to Webbville and south to Staffordsville.",
